; tests/time-portal-wish-band.fk — the time portal's one door, fkwu-witnessed.
;
; preludes: form-stdlib/core.fk cognition/time-portal-wish.fk
;
; Band verdict 1111111111111 when:
;   the true passage LANDS                                              ->            1
;   nothing offered yet WAITS — pending, not turned away                ->           10
;   a bargain is witnessed, not waited out                              ->          100
;   forgiveness: the true release is read, not the performed attempt    ->         1000
;   a passage mid-flight is honestly pending                            ->        10000
;   a trinket before space does not shadow the wish that follows        ->       100000
;   a release that is itself a landed passage counts as heartfelt       ->      1000000
;   a bargained inner passage cannot carry the outer one                ->     10000000
;   depth is VISIBLE: the space read answers node, sub-x-ray inside     ->    100000000
;   a loop after the gift thinks it away                                ->   1000000000
;   clarity ripens: a step answers yes, none yet is pending —           ->  10000000000
;     and a pending clarity never holds the gift
;   a divided release — heartfelt AND still grasping — does not land    -> 100000000000
;   purity answers yes when nothing is grasped, harmless to the rest    -> 1000000000000

(do
    (time-portal-wish-check))
